    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Ecole Sir John Franklin High School\\'s Drama Department proudly presents...Star Light Star Bright Our musical Stars will be shining brightly as we play and sing themes from popular movies like Star Wars, Raiders of the Lost Ark, Pocahontas and the Incredibles.  This concert will feature the Sir John Fiddlers in their debut performance.   Admission by donation...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
