    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;How do our lives intertwine? How do we manage to prosperous balances? What happens when they break down? Alteration addresses the transformations that punctuate our lives and our abilities to influence our own destiny and that of others. Aly Keita depicts an oscillating humanity on an intimate and societal level, between stability and uncertainty, anchoring...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
