    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Presented As part of the Northern Spark Emerging Artist Series A Collaboration Between NACC and The UNDerground Award-winning classical soprano Diana Rockwell returns to the North fresh from her Masters studies at the University of Manitoba with soprano Tracy Dahl. A dynamic and versatile performer, she has graced Yellowknife stages as an actor, dancer, singer...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
