    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Bella Dance Academy presents The Nutcracker, a timeless holiday tradition for the whole family! It’s Christmas Eve at the Silberhaus residence, and excitement runs high as last minute preparations are made. Guests begin to arrive to celebrate the holiday with Clara and her family. Arriving late in the midst of the celebration is Drosselmeyer, Clara’s...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
