    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A East Coast Treat! Old Man Luedecke is the recording and performing name of two-time JUNO award-winning and Polaris prize-nominated singer/songwriter Chris Luedecke. He’s a multiple East Coast Music Award winner known for his high-energy, banjo-driven stompers, touching guitar ballads, and dry, humorous stories. Old Man Luedecke has been making a soundtrack to an authentic...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
