      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;TOKARA was founded in Nagano Prefecture, Japan, by Wadaiko Artist Art Lee. The group has become a strong force in the world of Wadaiko (Taiko Drumming) both in Japan and internationally. While incorporating arrangements of traditional Taiko pieces into their performance, TOKARA has created an all-new style of Taiko, where electrifying speed and power meet...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
