        "@value": "We Will Rock You"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Ptarmigan Ptheatrics is pleased to present WE WILL ROCK YOU, featuring more than 20 hit Queen songs including “Another One Bites the Dust,” “Bohemian Rhapsody,” “Killer Queen,” “We Will Rock You,” “Somebody To Love,” “We Are the Champions,” “Don’t Stop Me Now,” and many more, WE WILL ROCK YOU follows two revolutionaries as they try...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
