        "@value": "CBC Radio’s The Debaters"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Now in its 19th season on CBC Radio One,&nbsp;The Debaters&nbsp;is the hit show where comics go toe-to-toe in a battle of laughs and logic. Hosted by Steve Patterson, international headliner and two-time winner of Canada’s Best Male Stand-Up, The Debaters is a combustible mix of sharply crafted comedic rants and hilarious ad-libs.The engaging format is...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
